WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.679
This image I hope it's coming up for you
of the willys group

00:00:03.679 --> 00:00:07.120
that group of supernatural women who
dance

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.920
angry men to death. You see this early
approach to dance combining

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.839
imagination with physical movement
investing movement with metaphor and

00:00:15.839 --> 00:00:18.400
meaning,
this became my guiding principle for my

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.720
work with Beckett. You see I found that
applying a similar process to his words

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.160
helped me
find an embodied performance,

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.400
particularly when I was adapting his
late prose without any of his stage

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.079
directions or choreography.

